@startuml
title Cd Player State Machine

[*] --> Stopped : system startup

state "Stopped" as Stopped
state "Playing" as Playing
state "Paused" as Paused

Stopped --> Playing : insert disc / press play
Playing --> Paused : press pause
Paused --> Playing : press resume
Playing --> Stopped : press stop
Pausing --> Resuming : press resume (added this transition)
Resuming --> Playing : continue playing from paused point (added this transition)

Stopped --> Stopped : no more discs

@enduml
